<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24477" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-stinguo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stinxi</span></b> ), stinctum, 3, v. a.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i>to
				separate</i>, <i>mark off</i>, <i>divide; to variegate</i> or <i>checker with</i>
			any thing (only in <i>perf. pass.</i>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spatia interstincta columnis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					S. 3, 5, 90</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">facies medicaminibus interstincta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					4, 57</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">candor interstinctus variis coloribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 10, 54, § 143</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aureum capitis figmentum interstinctum
					lapillis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 19, 1, 3</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>To extinguish</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quae faciunt ignes interstingui atque perire,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 761</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ardor interstinctis aquis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 9, § 915</span></i>
			
			<b>poet.</b>— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>To kill</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 4, p. 147, 34</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
